How do you optimize Databricks jobs?
    We optimize Databricks jobs at multiple levels—data, code, and cluster configuration.
    1. Data Optimization
        we use Liquid Clustering, 
    2. Query Optimization
        Avoid unnecessary columns (select only required fields) 
        Avoid wide transformations when possible
        Use broadcast joins for small tables
    3. Handling Skew & Shuffle
        Repartition data properly
        Handle data skew using salting techniques
        Minimize shuffle operations
    4. Cluster Optimization
        Choose appropriate cluster size and type
        Enable auto-scaling
        Use job clusters for batch jobs

